{"id":"560c33a2a83aebf2","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-langlands-group.md","title":"Langlands Representation Pair (Legacy Label)","display":"df-langlands-group — Langlands Representation Pair (Legacy Label)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-langlands-group","aliases":["58-df-langlands-group"],"display":"df-langlands-group — Langlands Representation Pair (Legacy Label)","depends_on":["[[58-df-galois-representation]]","[[../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-langlands-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-langlands-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-langlands-group — Langlands Representation Pair (Legacy Label)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"80c210450e512314\" href=\"?note=80c210450e512314\" title=\"58-df-galois-representation\">58-df-galois-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c13504d25a0786f0\" href=\"?note=c13504d25a0786f0\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md\">../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\pi,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E},G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}}\\in V\">\\(\\rho,\\pi,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E},G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"80c210450e512314\" href=\"?note=80c210450e512314\" title=\"58-df-galois-representation\">58-df-galois-representation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c13504d25a0786f0\" href=\"?note=c13504d25a0786f0\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md\">../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LanglandsRepresentationPair}_S:V^{17}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LanglandsRepresentationPair}_S:V^{17}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{LanglandsRepresentationPair}_S(\\rho,\\pi,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E},G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S(\\rho,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E})\\land\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S(\\pi,G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{LanglandsRepresentationPair}_S(\\rho,\\pi,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E},G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S(\\rho,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E})\\land\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S(\\pi,G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>现有上游只足以定义“一个 Galois 表示与一个显式自动表示数据共同给定”的配对；它不蕴含二者满足 Langlands 互反。</li>\n<li>原文件调用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentation}_S\\)</span> 并不存在；这里改为上游实际定义的十一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>真正的互反谓词还需新上游固定可接受的 Galois 表示类别、代数性/不可约性以及所有局部因子的匹配；本文件不把该猜想写成已证明全称定理。</li>\n<li>Base change: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gal}(\\bar{K}/K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Gal}(\\bar{K}/K)\\)</span> lifts to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb{A}_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb{A}_K)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Functoriality predicts transfer between groups.</li>\n<li>一般互反对应仍属 Langlands 纲领的猜想内容。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-galois-representation","status":"resolved","id":"80c210450e512314","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-galois-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md","status":"resolved","id":"c13504d25a0786f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-galois-representation","status":"resolved","id":"80c210450e512314","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-galois-representation]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md","status":"resolved","id":"c13504d25a0786f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-automorphic-representation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho,\\pi,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E},G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LanglandsRepresentationPair}_S:V^{17}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{LanglandsRepresentationPair}_S(\\rho,\\pi,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E},G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S(\\rho,G_F,n,E,\\tau_{G_F},\\tau_{n,E})\\land\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S(\\pi,G_A,m,i,e,R,\\mathcal H,B_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal H_\\pi,B_\\pi,R^{\\mathrm{reg}})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AutomorphicRepresentationData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gal}(\\bar{K}/K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb{A}_K)","display":false}],"bytes":2007,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-754","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-langlands-group.md|58-df-langlands-group]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["80c210450e512314","c13504d25a0786f0"]}